#!args --no-system-fonts --lang en
# JFDiagrammer, JD15: the region decides the units (LG-07) -- English without a region of its own
# is en-US: the drawing at start measures in inches (as the Shapes panel's US stencils do), and
# File › New offers US units first
cmd 4404
drag 500,330 640,420
cmd 4400
expect button:"Width: 2.50 in  Height: 1.50 in  Angle: 0°" exists
click tab:"File"
click button:"Basic Flowchart"
expect radio:"US Units" checked
expect radio:"Metric Units" unchecked
